      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree with the posting of this. Seeing the same information hundreds of times is a needless waste of space that could be spent reducing the amount of clicks required to achieve the reason you opened the menu to begin with. Both suggestions by op seem viable to me. A news tab with a notification icon, or an extra wing. This would allow a user to know if there is news to check, while also providing more real-estate for additional news as it would have it's own tab or wing which could be expanded on more later.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
