      "value": "I'd say the loading screen could have event messages for Spookality and other announcements. That information is important to be seen in game somewhere to keep players up to date on the platform and foster a healthy ecosystem. A news tab/button would be fine too. Or just allow it to be dismissed for good. \nWe definitely don't need 2/5th the menu being that big banner.",
